    "paragraph": "A dasymetric mapping workflow transformed street-address Boil Water Notice records from 2016 to 2024 in Jackson, Mississippi, into census block-level data to evaluate spatial exposure to water service disruptions. Cultural participation patterns across Valencia's districts were analyzed using individual and neighborhood-level data from the 2024 Municipal Public Opinion Barometer. Additionally, serial mediation analysis of 539 homeowners across seven South Korean metropolitan cities demonstrated that higher neighborhood housing price rank reduces depressive symptoms by elevating subjective social status and lowering status anxiety.",
